    "official": "Exusiai is a citizen of\nLaterano\nand as such, is entitled to the privileges listed in Clauses 1-13 of the Laterano Constitution. She is an employee of\nPenguin Logistics\nwho specializes in covert communication, armed escort, and other undercover activities. We suspect she is a Messenger. While contracted with Penguin Logistics, she serves as a liaison to\nRhodes Island\n, assisting us with our operations.",
