    {
      "section": "Clinical Analysis",
      "unlock": "Unlocked at 25 trust",
      "description": "Imaging tests reveal clear, normal outlines of internal organs, and no abnormal shadows have been detected. Originium granules have not been detected in the circulatory system and there is no sign of infection. At this time, this Operator is believed to be non-infected. \n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 0% \nOperator Exusiai showed no symptoms of Oripathy. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.12u/L \nOperator Exusiai sometimes delivers packages with Originium content, but it has not caused infection to date."
    },
    {
      "section": "Archive File 1",
      "unlock": "Unlocked at 50 trust",
      "description": "She is different from most Laterano in that she is an unabashed optimist. \nProficient in various means of entertainment, she's the member of the team who always manages to keep herself upbeat, no matter the situation.\nHer generosity ends up being the primary reason why she's broke all the time."
    },
    {
      "section": "Archive File 2",
      "unlock": "Unlocked at 100 trust",
      "description": "The gun is a unique mid and long-range weapon rumored to be discovered by Laterano, thereby becoming one of its symbols. \nIts killing power isn't exceptional, but it's better suited to the average Laterano citizen's temperament than cold steel, thus becoming the weapon of choice in Laterano. Everyone now carries at least one for personal protection. \nExusiai may seem laid-back, but her marksmanship ranks among the top at Rhodes Island. On one hand, she lacks the attention span for things other than maintaining and operating her gun. On the other hand, her innate marksmanship talents, including visual tracking and timing, are the envy of all sharpshooters."
    },
    {
      "section": "Archive File 3",
      "unlock": "Unlocked at 150 trust",
      "description": "While Exusiai goes against what anyone might expect of a Laterano, what's even more unbelievable is that she never endured a difficult childhood thanks to a peculiar hobby, nor did she decide to rebel due to some unfortunate circumstance. \nShe loves only happy things and grew up a happy person, simple as that. \nJudging from her background, maybe the Laterano aren't as closed-minded as popularly portrayed..."
    },
    {
      "section": "Archive File 4",
      "unlock": "Unlocked at 200 trust",
      "description": "Even with a halo and wings, people often forget Exusiai is a Laterano. Only when the topic swirls around religion does she react with the piety so characteristic of the Laterano. \nFew places outside Laterano hold such primordial, pristine faith, and because of that, very few notice Exusiai's piety. \nBut those who do will realize the same person holds such progressive values and at the same time retains reverence for her faith, without any apparent contradictions. \nAlso, only by observing Exusiai from this perspective could one realize that behind her wicked smirk lies a pure soul."
    },
    {
      "section": "Promotion Record",
      "unlock": "Unlocked at E2",
      "description": "Exusiai is my polar opposite. She seems to get along fine with anyone, but lets very few people close to her. \n—Texas"
    }
